asic hulls allow only simple upgrades, while advanced and expensive hulls unlock more depth. Each upgrade level becomes more costly, so managing your resources is crucial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/extras/58588de483ef1214055574091774b299.poster.avif?t=1755612440\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/extras/58588de483ef1214055574091774b299.webm?t=1755612440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/extras/58588de483ef1214055574091774b299.mp4?t=1755612440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>A crew with unique roles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your team consists of three specialists:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Commander</strong> boosts combat performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Engineer</strong> handles ship repairs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Navigator</strong> plots routes to special stations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All crew members gain experience and levels over time.<br>Their level unlocks new dialogue options, affects events, and increases bonuses.<br>You can also hire new members, dismiss old ones, or interact with them through in-game dialogues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/extras/993a21187a0129b047e955a26f297928.poster.avif?t=1755612440\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/extras/993a21187a0129b047e955a26f297928.webm?t=1755612440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/extras/993a21187a0129b047e955a26f297928.mp4?t=1755612440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reputation and factions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you do \u2014 from completing quests to making choices in events \u2014 affects your reputation.<br>It can unlock or block access to new missions, affect enemy levels, and influence what types of events or quests appear.<br>Reputation isn\u2019t just a number \u2014 it\u2019s a system that shapes how the world reacts to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This isn\u2019t a story about heroes.</i><br><br><br><br><i>It\u2019s a story about those who survive \u2014 day by day, jump by jump \u2014 on the edge of the void.</i></p>",
